---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
// Ported unchanged from the live site (wording is the client's). Needs client/legal review before launch:
// it mentions payment information, orders and a "Cookie Policy" that does not exist on the live site, and the
// new site uses different service providers (hosting, form handling).
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | HTS International"
  description="How HTS International collects, uses and protects personal information on www.hts.international."
>
  <div class="pagehead"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  </div></div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>At HTS International, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal data when you visit our website, www.hts.international, or interact with us in any way. Please take a moment to review this Privacy Policy carefully.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>When you visit our website or interact with us, we may collect the following types of information:</p>
      <h3>A. Personal information</h3>
      <ul><li>Name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Company name</li><li>Job title</li><li>Billing and shipping address</li><li>Payment information (if applicable)</li></ul>
      <h3>B. Non-personal information</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Log data (IP address, browser type, operating system)</li>
        <li>Cookies and similar technologies (please see our Cookie Policy for more details)</li>
        <li>Information about your interactions with our website and emails</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>A. Providing services:</strong> to provide you with information about our products and services, process your orders, and manage your account.</li>
        <li><strong>B. Communication:</strong> to respond to your inquiries, send you updates about our products, and inform you about promotions or events.</li>
        <li><strong>C. Personalisation:</strong> to personalise your experience on our website and tailor our offerings to your preferences.</li>
        <li><strong>D. Analytics:</strong> to analyse website traffic, improve our website's functionality, and enhance user experience.</li>
        <li><strong>E. Compliance:</strong> to comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Disclosure of your information</h2>
      <p>We may share your information with third parties in the following circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>A. Service providers:</strong> we may share your data with service providers who assist us in running our business, such as payment processors and shipping companies.</li>
        <li><strong>B. Legal compliance:</strong> we may disclose your information to comply with legal obligations or respond to lawful requests from government authorities.</li>
        <li><strong>C. Business transfers:</strong> in the event of a merger, acquisition, or sale of all or part of our assets, your information may be transferred to the acquiring entity.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>You have certain rights regarding your personal information, including the right to access, correct, or delete your data. You can also opt out of marketing communications at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:contact@hts.international">contact@hts.international</a>.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorised access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. Please check this page periodically for updates.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or concerns about our Privacy Policy or how we handle your personal information, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>HTS International<br />Email: <a href="mailto:contact@hts.international">contact@hts.international</a></p>
      <p>By using our website or providing your information to us, you consent to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
